- Best lab 7-stone entry: [Lab 1ct 7-Stone 14K White Gold at $2,980](https://www.bluenile.com/wedding-rings/seven-stone-asscher-lab-grown-diamond-ring-in-14k-white-gold-1-ct-tw-f-g-vs2-si1-item-202229?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — 7 step-cut windows across the top
