## Bezel-Set and Anniversary Styles

The bezel-set asscher anniversary ring offers a different visual character. Seven asscher cut stones are set in individual bezels — each stone has a thin metal rim around it rather than four prongs. The bezel adds a protective border around each step-cut window, which slightly softens the Hall of Corridors effect but gives the band a more modern, architectural appearance.

